{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "fe5c2ba3cec4bccc7f95713fdbc4daa4b7541c167fefc75c109ebbedafde2bfa", "ja": "ええええええっ！？", "zh": "欸欸欸欸欸欸！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "fe5c2ba3cec4bccc7f95713fdbc4daa4b7541c167fefc75c109ebbedafde2bfa", "ja": "ええええええっ！？", "zh": "欸欸欸欸欸欸！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "13e8932a391a5f8a88c26b1b33aa00149dad4a364e9df5011726708bf1020805", "ja": "あの人、歌織お姉ちゃんのパパだったの！？\nそ、そっか……う、うん、めっちゃダンディでした！", "zh": "那个人，是歌织姐姐的爸爸吗！？\n原、原来是这样啊……嗯、嗯，超级有成熟魅力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "d0996fdc854286ce72049155f2094603b414fd43d8f71ef605fe4b956a57ebc9", "ja": "うう、もう遅いよ真美～。ごめんなさい歌織さん、\n私たち、失礼なこと言っちゃって……。", "zh": "呜呜，已经太迟了啦真美～歌织小姐对不起，\n我们说了那么失礼的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "06f2ca5d800a701720923dc0ff107966c9892d730cc5f6528166ed8a27be5672", "ja": "いいのよ、気にしないでね。仕事柄、怖そうって\n思ってもらえた方が、本人も嬉しいと思うから。", "zh": "没关系的，别放在心上哦。出于工作性质，\n被觉得看起来挺吓人，他本人应该也挺高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "5c715d4bab293ea2df3406dd3924c3e4aebb3bf84f9e71bd0875d881d66ded22", "ja": "私の父は、自衛官をしているの。\n航空自衛隊の。", "zh": "我的父亲是一名自卫官。\n航空自卫队的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "1c1835cb618a9b42be02a385221407c1c6f8e2cc85c968fbf014e4dab9f0090d", "ja": "あ、そういえば聞いたことあるかも……あれ？\nでも、なんで自衛隊のお父さんが劇場にいるんですか？", "zh": "啊，说起来我好像听说过……咦？\n不过，为什么自卫队的爸爸会在剧场里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "76f2703e18968f34add26e9537fe7847f5d8492abc1ffbeeb677fed240f77221", "ja": "はっ！　まさか兄ちゃんの顔を見に来たとか？\n「そうか、貴様が娘をたぶらかした虫か」みたいな！？", "zh": "哈！难道是专程来看哥哥的吗？  \n比如说“原来如此，你就是勾引我女儿的那只虫子”之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "db5a3777c05d6a10072372aca7b702ec3b9e4ce99516102481e27dfc5f932945", "ja": "た、確かにご挨拶もしていたけれど、\nそういうのじゃなくて……。", "zh": "确、确实是来打过招呼，不过不是那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1009_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2629f9ff26f6adc0669fa52117126438db8f5cfb24b7e0934d7e2ed8cdc19276", "ja": "お、みんな揃ってるな。歌織さん、\nさっきはお父様のご紹介、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "哦，大家都到齐了啊。歌织小姐，刚才谢谢您介绍令尊给我认识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "483723d21f761cb2ea3e7af23831666b2d4c8cc8251edc3b318f887ae0cd44c3", "ja": "いいえ、{$P$}さんこそお忙しいのに\n時間を取っていただいて。ありがとうございました。", "zh": "不，是{$P$}先生您才对，明明那么忙还抽出时间来。谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "15ce9a2047b4fb40d42287ff948910a7651f6a68065579654de614b052b4b3d5", "ja": "歌織ちゃん歌織ちゃんっ。\n私たちも、お父様とお話ししちゃった♪　うふふ♪", "zh": "歌织，歌织！我们也和你爸爸聊了会儿呢♪嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5eee292eacd490b862ec1bea528c94f0027083eac502f98815c062424a17ca29", "ja": "偶然、廊下でお会いしたんです。\nとても紳士的な、素敵なお父様ですね。", "zh": "我们正好在走廊碰到了。\n真是位非常绅士、优秀的父亲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "077ef81a7618d8414b13e04b7a893bc652c3f579508a809745952d70cb404289", "ja": "まあ、そうだったの。……なんだか、心配になって\nきちゃった。父はなにか、変なこと言ってなかった？", "zh": "哎呀，是这样啊。……总觉得，有些担心\n起来了。我父亲没说什么奇怪的话吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "ad8c18279c3582ff8635d0ccf492800333aea93778f8c268c9494b8982c8f318", "ja": "いいえ、普通に歌織ちゃんのことをよろしくって♪\n…あ、あと、朝は特によろしくって。何のこと？", "zh": "没有，他只是说请多多关照歌织♪  \n……啊，还有，早上尤其要多多关照。是什么意思呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "3fdcc7f4838a1b11757e6b51e96fcd7b72999e4b8923b54d9eec17433e896859", "ja": "……パパのばかぁ……！\nき、気にしないでね、あずさちゃんっ！", "zh": "……爸爸这个笨蛋……！\n别、别在意哦，梓姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "683836c5e90550d1a93fd2bc16760d6705c6a691eb14ae16d782621dd3ee58da", "ja": "劇場での桜守さんの様子なども気にされていました。\n……とても大切に思われているんですね。", "zh": "还很在意樱守小姐在剧场里的情况之类的。\n……看来他真的非常珍视您呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1018_p", "source_sha256": "65f5f9e8c07ff91ed71bba99ebbe31c4368d8c25592a67b7c4698988dbbe9f92", "ja": "厳格そうな方でしたけど、きっと歌織さんには優しい、\n子煩悩なお父さんなんでしょうね！", "zh": "虽然看起来是位很严厉的人，但对歌织小姐一定很温柔，是个疼爱女儿的爸爸吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "85d5fa2431dd4f2e181ba94c36f2fec9823292b4536737b4ac6c2762235a288e", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。もう、お父さんったら、\n私に隠れて……帰ったらひとこと言わなくちゃっ。", "zh": "是、是这样呢……真是的，爸爸居然瞒着我……回去后可得说他两句。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "a27df548e5ea6c7b042fc187d0440bf07fcd49521e01014d2ab96f8041c0e73f", "ja": "なんか、いいなぁ～。歌織さんのパパさん、\n私もお話ししてみたかったです！", "zh": "感觉真不错啊～歌织姐的爸爸，我也好想和他聊聊天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "d31180c33789c048c3eb942ad8c8a095c8a2a960e5ecf51486e5e1e4e9487629", "ja": "真美もゴアイサツしたかったなー。\n仲良くなったら、戦闘機に乗せてもらえるかもだし！", "zh": "真美也想去打个招呼啊——\n要是和他搞好关系，说不定还能让他带我坐战斗机呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1022_p", "source_sha256": "96436153a48a84a146ef98326bddc106393855d4055687d8a4c51d4690a68aa6", "ja": "大丈夫。挨拶なら二人とも、\nすぐに機会があるかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "没关系。打招呼的话，你们两个\n可能马上就会有机会哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "42a22b1547d1be0e2c099ff5b47b210cb3ead9b62002f6e7ae049424f35e474e", "ja": "えっ、どして？　……はっ！　まさか兄ちゃん、\n真美とみらいっちを自衛隊に入れて鍛え直す気！？", "zh": "咦，为什么？……啊！难道哥哥你打算让真美和未来一起加入自卫队，重新锻炼吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e7ff5af3bb36af8baae0a59df671dbb3904cac6715f443cd744504a6f7c6a81", "ja": "ええっ、私まで！？\nそ、そうなんですか、{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "诶诶，连我也要！？  \n难、难道是这样吗，{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1025_p", "source_sha256": "75c695463b92ce3beacccb193a44bb0e0045344e504f601cec1ed4bd68564cdc", "ja": "鍛え直される心当たりがあるのか…？　そうじゃなくて\n実は、お父さんから仕事のオファーをもらったんだ。", "zh": "你是觉得自己有什么地方需要重新锻炼吗……？不是那个意思。其实，我从父亲那里接到了工作委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5110be69d1e277ad2e9d23cb62634a4bbe725ebc9a68cbf397096910b5615749", "ja": "航空自衛隊の音楽隊の定期演奏会に、ゲストボーカル\nとして、歌織さんに出演してもらいたいそうだ。", "zh": "听说想请歌织小姐作为嘉宾主唱，出演航空自卫队音乐队的定期演奏会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4641006a14b803e858653f2e91601a9870e64a83aa28af090aebeade070bd3a9", "ja": "自衛隊の演奏会……！　たしか桜守さんは、\n以前もそこで歌われていたんですよね？", "zh": "自卫队的演奏会……！我记得樱守小姐以前也在那里唱过，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "6653bd886c4358b122bc74ee1143ddd38dfc06cb7389f33fd4f7ff36aa860abc", "ja": "ええ、アイドルになる前に、少しだけね。\n久しぶりに、また歌ってみないかって。", "zh": "嗯，在成为偶像之前，曾在那里唱过一阵子。\n他们问我，要不要时隔许久再去唱一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "f9d2f24f4d15260c0c3a0b4695de4fe9cdc8170db1af616a59b2c3727b9eec19", "ja": "今回は、今までより規模も大きいみたいで。\n他にもゲストの方がたくさん来るそうよ♪", "zh": "这次的规模好像也比以往更大。\n听说还会有很多其他嘉宾来呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1030_p", "source_sha256": "b9ff7b8d8f3e7076b0570feb16b48e5b8b1772db43691121f409b8803e2bc2a9", "ja": "オペラ歌手や演奏家の人たち。\nその方面では一線級のメンバーばかりでしたね。", "zh": "歌剧歌手和演奏家们。\n全都是各自领域的一流人物呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "be31190c6b30a7e41174485fa960fa35c82cc11e8d3e410572ea9d061b3cc517", "ja": "まあ、そんな豪華な演奏会に呼ばれるなんて、\nさすが歌織ちゃんね♪", "zh": "能被邀请参加那么豪华的演奏会，真不愧是歌织呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "5440223db63db5b77e1d4ae3b49dca3261743c7a551dbe363cbffca7962d450f", "ja": "ううん、私は父のツテだから、オマケみたいなものよ。\nでも、嬉しいお誘いだなって。", "zh": "没有啦，我是托了父亲的人脉，只是个附带的而已啦。\n不过，能收到邀请真的很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1033_p", "source_sha256": "d185737a2132ab1ef9a8b37431eff4330fac10870578ec5ab64c0674604fc39c", "ja": "歌織さんの新曲もできたところだし、お披露目公演に\n先駆けて演奏会ライブで発表！というのもいいですね。", "zh": "歌织的新歌也刚完成，不如在正式公演之前，先在演奏会现场的演出中发表！这个主意也不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1034_p", "source_sha256": "06b55ca8080fe5350af5437ff32d5393258d654ecad3ea21dfbe0f9ef325e8de", "ja": "どうでしょう、歌織さん。事前にお話は聞いていたと\n思いますが……。やってみますか？", "zh": "歌织小姐，您觉得怎么样？之前应该已经听说过这件事了……要不要试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1035_052kao", "source_sha256": "3ca441118471ceb89f73132a015c312cd1e208c3cf81440982030731fcbe8caf", "ja": "はい。ぜひ、やらせてください！　以前に歌った時とは\n違う、アイドルになった私の、私だけの歌……。", "zh": "好的。请务必让我来唱！这首歌和以前唱过的不同，是成为偶像后的我、只属于我的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "f034803bd89abbd83d07b38cc606d3f3e458a404884c3cb461308aada0f02540", "ja": "それを父にも、お世話になった\n音楽隊のみなさんにも、見てもらいたいです！", "zh": "我也想让父亲，还有一直关照我的乐队各位看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1037_p", "source_sha256": "8d3f44f71e6f1ecd675f37e705488e91fb9c1b3969c0c865f582c8c5935bb09e", "ja": "わかりました。アイドルとしての歌織さんの姿を、\n見せてあげましょう！", "zh": "我明白了。就让他们见识一下，\n歌织身为偶像的身姿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1038_p", "source_sha256": "b520f6e5e8e68e3f7699b3e445308ade42c3a341c706abdc5f3eecebff8cc71f", "ja": "ここにいるみんなには、演奏会ライブと公演のサポート\nをしてもらいたいと思ってるんだけど、どうかな？", "zh": "我想请在场的各位为演奏会、演唱会和公演提供支持，你们觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1039_012mam", "source_sha256": "167d5233b90f3ccba4d1827ce602218c4fa293b4e64e7bab91e2b878c0e7961c", "ja": "ついにエースパイロットになる時が来たようだね……。\nもちろん、めっちゃ頑張るー！", "zh": "终于到了成为王牌飞行员的时候呢……。\n当然会超级努力的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1040_p", "source_sha256": "3520681508b4ff2f73c18a2b590cdf1d257408a3dbb07a54aac8cc7c0d012d58", "ja": "おお、定期演奏会は音楽ホールでやるから\nパイロットごっこはできないが、しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "哦，定期演奏会要在音乐厅举行，\n没法玩飞行员游戏了，不过可要好好拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "6e548a7f79c0716e0454b150c92f4e237f7e805cedee7451e100720a5fdd14b4", "ja": "私も私も、演奏会出たいです！　飛行機も好きだし！\n歌織さんのサポート、がんばりまーす！", "zh": "我也是我也是，我也想参加演奏会！因为我也喜欢飞机！我会努力为歌织小姐提供支持——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "305780a17ffb5a5b138913f6cbe9d46a609d222b593f9001a2c567a7f4bf0e60", "ja": "桜守さんの晴れ舞台に、少しでもお役に立てるの\nでしたら。よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "如果能为樱守小姐的重要舞台尽上一点绵薄之力的话，\n还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1043_010azu", "source_sha256": "9b175287b3ce0fdd4e433d9ac523fe865363cc22bb8875804d4e56382cb2fdd2", "ja": "うふふっ、音楽隊の生演奏でライブができるなんて、\nとっても素敵……。よろしくね、歌織ちゃん♪", "zh": "呵呵，能在乐队的现场演奏下举办演唱会，真是太棒了……拜托你啦，歌织♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_126_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_126_1044_052kao", "source_sha256": "3d9e2bb23a603fa0619fe8c4f3b86847b6b1aa9149bf51264693e8c8abcf164a", "ja": "みんな、ありがとう！\n一緒にいいステージにしましょうね！", "zh": "谢谢大家！\n我们一起打造一个精彩的舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
